  "decision_summary": "Direct human and rodent CSF/plasma and brain/plasma measurements for imatinib and related analogs consistently show poor CNS access. Positive BBB-crossing evidence exists in a few less-similar compounds, but the robust negative direct evidence and uniformly low Morgan similarity support a fail prediction.",
